000006AA: TEXT 082A FF 20 80 - - 056D 0570 003E 0313 033E 02E7 02ED 0577 057B 0584 00D6 0588 03BB 058C 0590 0594 020E 059A 059F 00D6 ; TEXT line=0x082A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Of course you can wake Cap'n Bob and question him ... But like not too often , okay ? ..."
